Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hFull
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.21,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:31.76,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud to be here.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be here.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a break.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way we could stop Ken\Nwas to defeat our friend Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found the Digi-Egg of Friendship, but\NFlymon found us and captured Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.82,0:01:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all chased after him,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it led us right into MetalGreymon\Nwith Ken riding the controls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon arrived and freed Patamon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but no one could remove the\NDark Spiral from MetalGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.24,0:01:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis was still having a problem\Nfighting his Digimon friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we convinced him that\Nsometimes friends have
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.28,0:01:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to make sacrifices for\Nthe sake of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just then, the Digi-Egg\Nfriendship activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Paildramon destroyed the\Ndark spirals on MetalGreymon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and allowed him to\Ndigivolve back into Agumon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.18,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx115\fscy115\pos(315,328)}Duel on the Digimon Ranch
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, nice serve, Gwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a little dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, why don't you two play?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, nice serve, Gwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beumon's in trouble, but how\Nwill I get to the Digi-World?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.36,0:02:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to tell the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cabinet rinse makes\Nmy ears look too stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rome wasn't built in a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking beautiful takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.54,0:03:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you help me wash the dishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tides up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are your ears standing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a new look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite degrading, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, most cats like mice, not moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, my stomach is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't eat so much in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ate twice as much as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep it up, you'll\Ndigivolve into heavy mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.28,0:03:45.74,email,,0,0,0,,{\org(524,164)\frz5.428\fscx110\fscy110\pos(534,160)}From: Sora
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.82,0:03:45.74,email,,0,0,0,,{\frz5.24\fscx125\fscy125\pos(368,434)}SOS from Piyomon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.94,0:03:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An emergency call from Biyomon? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Biyomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needs our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:04:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nothing to shake a stick at.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Note to self, think a better way\Nto sneak Upamon out of apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, be more careful next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.16,0:04:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, what have you been eating lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have gained 20 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Upamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ate Upamon? Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora sent an email saying\NBeamon's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.14,0:04:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your tummy's growling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way not to look\Nsuspicious is to sneak quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.24,0:04:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's TK and Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't my turn to watch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No TK or Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if they were out of town,\Nat least they'd email us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, that milkshake was really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But seeing you drink through\Na straw was even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can take some pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fish market's calling my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, maybe their batteries are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe TK decided to wash in the bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to go without them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.49,0:05:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see exactly where Biomon's\Ndistress signal came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now that we know where we need\Nto get, let's get to getting to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.43,0:05:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.14,0:05:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Gate, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bulb, I sense this\Nplace is a cultural desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.78,0:05:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sandblasting sure makes\Nmy shell look real shiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the Old West.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's that spire we saw on the monitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see a control spire anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear not, Yoli, for I will guard you from\Nwhatever danger may be thrust upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of guarding my life,\Ntry finding us some cold water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Biomar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't have gone far, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.74,0:06:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's that music coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.82,0:06:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when there's a Gila monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.18,0:06:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a player piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think\Nthat there's nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're at the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're set just where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure to be happy here,\Nso says the mon behind the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.31,0:07:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Digi-Pilgrims, to the\Nsafest town west of Cirrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They call me Starmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starmon is a law and order\NDigimon who keeps the peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you break the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his powerful meteor shower will\Nrain down swift justice upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now belly up to the bar so I can welcome\Nall of you with a cold mug of welcome milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't spill a drop, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just my way of being\Nneighborly to strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, here's to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what is welcome milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 100% homogenized\Nmoo juice, little missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention\Nit, I'm kind of thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mouth feels like a clothes\Ndryer full of cotton balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My tongue is a dusty tank tread.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tourists, you gotta love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Mr. Starmon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have you by any chance\Nseen a cute little pink
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bird-looking Digimon\Nnamed Biyomon around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, did you say Biyomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of rings a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, yep, I got a feeling I've\Nheard that description before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.94,0:08:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beumon wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did she do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that Digi-Desperado is on\Nthe run from the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a reward out for her,\Nbut they haven't caught her yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she's hopefully\Nsomewhere safe by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'll still feel a lot\Nbetter when we find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starmon, sir, maybe you could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.30,0:08:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard she was last seen near here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't be more\Nright about that, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if Beumon were in\Ntrouble, you'd help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being a Leomon, I know you'd protect\Nher from that digital emperor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ma 'am, there's something\NI gotta tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.39,0:08:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's wearing a dark ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that behind that kin\Nstar was just a gutless,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,low-life lackey of the emperor\Nwith jelly for a spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.62,0:08:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have told us, and what\Ndo we say about name-calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the jury's\Nstill out on Starmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think he's a bad apple or a good one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are like milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can turn bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:08:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might think I'm lower than\Na snake's belly for saying this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I do work for the\NEmperor, and I got orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hunt them down and\Npunish the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that Earth Reject doing\Nnow, pulling wings off butterflies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can bet he's experimenting\Nwith something evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth Reject.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to use that at the next\Ncompany picnic and team-building seminar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't that beat all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No use trying to hot tail it out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for a weather report.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.94,0:09:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned heavy showers,\Nbut that was too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you'll enjoy your stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No cookies in your cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No loud music after eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and no shucking oysters\Nduring months without an R.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zahra!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to get away, but I\Njust didn't have the strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh, don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just said don't talk, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you would make up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kay, you can talk a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I first came here to this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea that it was under\Nthe control of the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had been shot down by his\Nflying dragons and needed food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was tired, hungry, and very thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:10:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your throat must be parched.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.86,0:11:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a cold drink of milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right. I am thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.90,0:11:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you can stay a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V, headbutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.84,0:11:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I used too much V\Nand not enough headbutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wall's as hard as his\Nhead and just as thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it should be easy for you\Nto drill through that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve into Digmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too weak to do it. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could do something if I had food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, Yoli, I sure wish we had\Nsome snacks from your store.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll call my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He delivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:11:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Yoli, we're in prison\Nin the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:11:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's more than five miles,\Nthere's a delivery charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What, Biyomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs some new shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.18,0:12:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never fear, the protector\Nof justice is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy guacamole, just who\Nin tarnation are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howdy, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deputy Mon is a barrel-chested\NDigimon that shoots from the lip,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but usually he's helpful and harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the look on your faces, I feel\Nlike I squashed your favorite hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got put in this jail for doing\Nnothing by your partner, Star Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's all that's in here, just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.49,0:12:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your dark ring, deputy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, see for yourself,\NI ain't got no ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody controls me, not even myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no dark ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:13:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right toe, you varmints.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sorry to be so suspicious of you,\Ndeputy mon, but put yourself in our boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, you see any rings now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.34,0:13:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.28,0:13:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Deputy Mon, are you here to\Nkeep us in jail or to set us free?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to fret, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm only\Nfreeing the girls. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need card players, but not boys,\Nbecause they cheat. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I mention I don't\Neven cheat at solitaire?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strictly womenfolk, and that's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you ever hear of women,\Nchildren, and Digimon first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you find it in\Nyour heart to make an
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exception and let us all\Ngo just for the fun of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, ladies only. Scoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this, the petrified desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, Scoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're not, boys! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giddy up, cellophane!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's lunchtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being a ruthless villain\Nsure works up an appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after lunch, a little nap, so\NI'll be my mean old self again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hee hee hee. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deputy Monfrey the girl\Nsays boys cheat at cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I imagine they're enjoying some\Ndelicious snacks right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.57,0:14:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna let that popcorn\Nhave it with both barrels!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at that. And what?\NHis lunch. I can smell it. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I could just wrap my lips around\Nthat lunch, I could armor Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.24,0:14:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea. What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretend that these ropes around us are\Npasta and help yourself to all you can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mamma mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just love cards, credit cards,\Ngreeting cards, you name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.92,0:14:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a show-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a couple of hands,\Nlet's try to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:15:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could get him to fall asleep\Nby talking him into playing canasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.24,0:15:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever play 52 pick-ups? Ah, skip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,welcome to the world\Nchampionship of Old May.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Winner-take-all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know any ways of cheating\Nwhen it comes to playing Old Maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost got it, Jeebus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to figure a way to break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chocolate always works.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.98,0:15:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.82,0:15:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delicious roast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.36,0:15:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All righty, you're first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't try anything trickier,\Nno fruit cup, you hear? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it ain't that namby-pamby\Npoor excuse for a sidekick, Deputymon,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,playin' with the girls\Nagain, Georgie Porgie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop that talk, you got no right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For once, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.74,0:15:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time for talkin' is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's settle this once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:15:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:15:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.10,0:16:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those ropes were just\Na high-fiber appetizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, bon appetit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.92,0:16:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks mighty tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the easiest way\Nout of here is to dig out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll help out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have some. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just this once, it's\Nokay to gulp your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta help our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.08,0:16:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor, energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, armor, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, armor, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.22,0:16:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, armor, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, the drill of power, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.60,0:16:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:17:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, armor, decimon, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor, decimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, the storm of friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The storm of friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this ghost town isn't\Nbig enough for both of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us even if we had it on\Ni saw a movie like this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once the good guy won\Nwhich one's good take
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three paces then turn\Naround and fire ready one
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two go whoever two and\Nseven sixteenths and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey that's right i've\Nalready turned around
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.78,0:17:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good guys aren't supposed to cheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.94,0:17:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm not that good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.90,0:18:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I've never won at nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But today, win, lose, or draw,\NI'm coming out this a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is becoming a battle of wits, and it\Nlooks like Deputy Mon's out of ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.26,0:18:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Semi-good always triumphs over\Nevil, so go ahead, Starmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me your best shot. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just see how the\Nfortune cookie crumbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I dropped him like a bad habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like one down and\Ntwo to go. Not quite!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too much chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to cut back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.56,0:19:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divus, digivolve me into Fladramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a better fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Right, V-mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.04,0:19:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimental Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.12,0:19:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Armor, Digivolve, do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.14,0:19:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lycrumon, the Fire of Courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starmon, you're fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A control splatter! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks to us, you'll be free\Nfrom the Emperor's control any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a tough job, but\Nsomeone had to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I just went plum loco.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope there's no hard feelings, Beaumont.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad that things are normal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tarnation, it's good that I caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.40,0:20:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think all of you were\Ngonna skedaddle You didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know about us saying adios\Nand playing some art cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.09,0:20:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those Digidimlets have no\Nidea what I have up my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.22,0:20:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what have you got, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.68,0:21:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got two pair, a pair of\Naces and another pair of aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That beats us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.52,0:21:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're switching to my\Nfavorite card game, Goldfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goldfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait a minute.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I tell the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I tell the world?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait a minute. It's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.74,0:21:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't kiss you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're like you're just like okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so liquid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.19,0:21:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.38,0:21:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.62,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.62,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.88,0:22:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.12,0:22:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.64,0:23:00.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx130\fscy130\pos(320,333)}Dagomon's Call
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the gate.

